    [38;5;230m- Root cause: /bin/bash (3.2, macOS default) appeared before /opt/homebrew/bin/
bash (5.3.9, homebrew) in PATH[39m
    [38;5;230m- Why only me: The .zshrc PATH builder on line 22 never included /opt/homebrew/
bin, relying on system /etc/zprofile which puts /usr/bin:/bin first[39m
    [38;5;230m- Impact: Hermes' terminal() tool spawns new shells that inherit the default PA
TH → bash = 3.2 → hit the register script parsing bug[39m
    [38;5;230m- Fix: Added /opt/homebrew/bin as the first PATH entry in .zshrc line 22[39m
